On the first complete real anchor, the corrected scalar replay matches the batch evaluator and has zero uncapped `NO_MODE` or demoted-rate misses. The rain check also needs a distinction: actual decoding margin includes realised fading and interference, so it is not simply one adjacent ladder step.
