+| Margin provisioned | UNILATERAL | 58 / 316,652 | 0.018% | 0.016% | 0 |
+| Margin provisioned | ORACLE_SET | 0 / 342,380 | 0.000% | 0.000% | 0 |
+
+Pooling the three selectors, the occupancy breakdown is:
+
