+    f"- [Original reproduction audit]({HERE}/original-reproduction-audit.json), [selector/result audit]({HERE}/strict-result-audit.json), [clearance fixture audit]({HERE}/strict-variant-audit.json), and [numerical failure trace]({HERE}/uncapped-margin-failure-trace.json)."
+)
